ontrols","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3705830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Full Controller Support!</h1><p>With update 1.1 you can now use your controller with the game and you can remap the controller inputs as well enjoy!! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/bfaec61c1239207745ba7aee0dbc4be8.avif?t=1773174596\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><br><h1>New Trailer</h1><p>There is a new trailer for Zombie Liminal Fishing! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/501d94b83462a6f07ea7abf2deaf3a1b.avif?t=1773174596\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Break open crates. Grab weapons. Dual wield anything. Wreck zombies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/90e9f8d691d4d1bf28030cd54a8fe655.poster.avif?t=1773174596\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/90e9f8d691d4d1bf28030cd54a8fe655.webm?t=1773174596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/90e9f8d691d4d1bf28030cd54a8fe655.mp4?t=1773174596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Smash, shoot, and blow up zombies. Or just beat them down with punches and kicks.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/9433a6acd19304634364eb0366c49054.poster.avif?t=1773174596\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/9433a6acd19304634364eb0366c49054.webm?t=1773174596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/9433a6acd19304634364eb0366c49054.mp4?t=1773174596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Break zombies into pieces of meat. Harvest and transport the zombie meat to be used as bait for fish and crabs.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/a40d140d907a7ee72ef949738da82dcf.poster.avif?t=1773174596\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/a40d140d907a7ee72ef949738da82dcf.webm?t=1773174596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/a40d140d907a7ee72ef949738da82dcf.mp4?t=1773174596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Use zombie meat as fishing bait for automatic fishing systems. Load zombie meat into traps to catch crabs. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/f1075e96d7eef2018ef03e7ab181190a.poster.avif?t=1773174596\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/f1075e96d7eef2018ef03e7ab181190a.webm?t=1773174596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/f1075e96d7eef2018ef03e7ab181190a.mp4?t=1773174596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Optimize your logistics with conveyor belts, robots, and teleporters to deliver your catch and maximize profits.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/2d039174346c60fa6901b0a626ecb182.poster.avif?t=1773174596\" width=610 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/2d039174346c60fa6901b0a626ecb182.webm?t=1773174596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/extras/2d039174346c60fa6901b0a626ecb182.mp4?t=1773174596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Use cash to unlock new areas and upgrade ammunition capacity, ammunition type, melee weapons, high explosives, and more.<br>","developers":["Chris Danelon"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419660/e1588c491a117e7c61c822b00cf0c51c3c3a4b93/header.jpg?t=1773174596","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026, Chris Danelon, all rights reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3419660/1156340063/fdd54412fca7000b372070436993d731027221b8/1753822698/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753823919","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3419660/1156340063/fdd54412fca7000b372070436993d731027221b8/1753822698/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753823919","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3419660/1156340063/fdd54412fca7000b37207